{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>XENO DEAD</i></strong><i> is a fast-paced FPS tinged with a melancholic atmosphere.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>After aliens have come to the planet Earth to siphon it's resources, the humans decide it best to call in their strongest weapon... you, the Assassin.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WEAPONRY</strong>: Tear through enemies with specially crafted weapons built for your capabilities.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE WATCH</strong>: Strategically place watch abilities to turn any battle in your favor.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPGRADES</strong>: Find AlienTech hidden throughout your journey to upgrade your equipment and become even deadlier.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281940/extras/671840459c661620c3d36d39d2a971c8.avif?t=1756194872\" data-has-big width=1600 height=1600 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I SEE YOU</strong>: WE WILL MEET.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3281940?t=1756194872","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281940/b0facb41b6c12399c41b2cc37316307986ed6232/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756194872","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281940/a35eb2bb605c56572b1829cf04fa6837bb03b018/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756194872","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281940/a35eb2bb605c56572b1829cf04fa6837bb03b018/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756194872","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"descriptio